# Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 27), 10019's free-slot test (getFreeSlotsCount() == 0) on both sides: accepted by GM
# at fame level 1 (the fame is read only while available), the whisper held, a full inventory: option 1 is refused
# (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED Ramuh's Staff, not completed, the whisper kept), option 0 and option 7 likewise
# (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0). Options 5 (10000 gil) and 6 (the Ramuh spell) need no slot: user ruling 2026-11-04 (kept
# Lua bugs), the test is `option ~= 5 and option ~= 6`, so with a full inventory each completes (the Lua's `or` always
# held and refused them too, ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0). Between them a GM's delQuest and addQuest and the whisper
# again. With one free slot (the bag grown by one; the test is == 0): option 1 completes, Quest[4][27]Prog 1 (GM) kept
# (the raw player:completeQuest).
char zone=Mhaura pos=30.6,-15.6,56.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted
keyitem WhisperOfStorms
login
fill-inventory
trigger Ripapa                            # accepted, the whisper: 10019 (0, fork, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=1                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED (Ramuh's Staff)
trigger Ripapa                            # 10019
finish option=0                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0
trigger Ripapa                            # 10019
finish option=7                           # no free slot: ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED 0
trigger Ripapa                            # 10019
finish option=5                           # 10000 gil (no slot needed); the title, the whisper taken; completed
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning available # a GM: delQuest
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted  # a GM: addQuest
keyitem WhisperOfStorms                   # a GM
trigger Ripapa                            # 10019 (0, fork, 5, 0, 0)
finish option=6                           # the Ramuh spell (no slot needed): RAMUH_UNLOCKED; completed
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning available # a GM
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted  # a GM
keyitem WhisperOfStorms                   # a GM
storage inventory 31                      # one free slot (the bag one larger): the test is == 0, so it gives
charvar Quest[4][27]Prog 1                # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Ripapa                            # 10019 (0, fork, 5, 0, 32: the spell held)
finish option=1                           # Ramuh's Staff; completed; Quest[4][27]Prog kept
